  "commands": [
    "PRIV-PUB-01 — Create a new detached review-only checkout; verify immutable target, clean state and exact tree equality with the prior privacy-reviewed commit.",
    "PRIV-PUB-02 — Recompute SHA-256 for all eight privacy-required authorities, mapping, ADR, semantic boundaries, fixtures, recipes and source provenance; compare the prior envelope and all thirty hash-bound source/evidence artifacts.",
    "PRIV-PUB-03 — Independently compare all seventeen inherited retention rules, Specifications archive ownership, while-referenced/P5Y lifecycle, P35D backup ceiling, candidate metadata and exact policy-to-ADR decision identifier.",
    "PRIV-PUB-04 — Reuse the unchanged prior storage and Missions targeted suites and twenty-six independent privacy probes; verify recorded successful outcomes and original artifact hashes. No heavy suite or probe execution is claimed for this pass.",
    "PRIV-PUB-05 — Read the unchanged mapping, ADR and Missions privacy boundaries; check minimization, terminal-reference history, current authorization separation, deletion and restore limitations without introducing a new interpretation.",
    "PRIV-PUB-06 — Validate this envelope against the original review-verdict.v0.1 validator and assigned job; check repository-relative public paths, absence of machine/personal paths and raw shell commands, and clean detached source after review."
  ],
